            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">THE FINAL SPRINT</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"23\">From contract to publication</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"250\" width=\"220\" height=\"140\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.2)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"170\" y=\"310\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Ogden reads</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"345\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">and champions</text><path d=\"M280 320 L340 320\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><polygon points=\"340,320 328,312 328,328\" fill=\"#14b8a6\"/><rect x=\"340\" y=\"250\" width=\"220\" height=\"140\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.2)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"450\" y=\"310\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Late 1941</text><text x=\"450\" y=\"345\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">contract signed</text><path d=\"M560 320 L620 320\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><polygon points=\"620,320 608,312 608,328\" fill=\"#14b8a6\"/><rect x=\"620\" y=\"250\" width=\"220\" height=\"140\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.2)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"730\" y=\"310\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Jan 1, 1943</text><text x=\"730\" y=\"345\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">deadline met</text><path d=\"M840 320 L880 320\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><polygon points=\"880,320 868,312 868,328\" fill=\"#14b8a6\"/><rect x=\"880\" y=\"250\" width=\"180\" height=\"140\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.2)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"970\" y=\"310\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">May 1943</text><text x=\"970\" y=\"345\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">published</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"520\" width=\"800\" height=\"200\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"590\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">ABOUT TWO-THIRDS OF THE NOVEL</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"640\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">was written in roughly one year</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"680\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">after the contract was signed</text></svg>",
            "caption": "Archibald Ogden's advocacy led to a contract and a year-long writing sprint."
