            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">THE THEME, IN HER WORDS</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"23\">Rand, looking back in 1968</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"220\" width=\"900\" height=\"300\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"320\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"30\">Individualism versus collectivism,</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"375\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"30\">not in politics</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"430\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"30\">but in the soul</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"620\" width=\"440\" height=\"200\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">NOT ABOUT</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"745\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">elections or economics</text><rect x=\"580\" y=\"620\" width=\"440\" height=\"200\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"800\" y=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">ABOUT</text><text x=\"800\" y=\"745\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">how a person lives</text></svg>",
            "caption": "Rand framed the novel as a psychological drama rather than a political one."
