" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Cardboard characters -- the bedroom scene</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"625\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Concern for others -- Cortlandt</text></svg>",
