            "type": "diagram",
            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">YOUR VERDICT</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"23\">Five closing questions</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"160\" width=\"800\" height=\"90\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"215\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">1. The hero: be, work with, live near?</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"280\" width=\"800\" height=\"90\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"335\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">2. The villain: fair portrait or caricature?</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"400\" width=\"800\" height=\"90\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(59,130,246,0.15)\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"455\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">3. The tragedy: who is most human?</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"520\" width=\"800\" height=\"90\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"575\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">4. The hard scene: your judgment</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"640\" width=\"800\" height=\"90\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"695\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">5. One idea to keep, one to reject</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"790\" width=\"700\" height=\"90\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"845\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"22\">Argue both sides -- then decide first-hand</text></svg>",
